sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Proveedor<br/>(wompi/payu/mock)
  participant R as Adapter REST<br/>(routes/webhooks)
  participant UC as PaymentsUseCases<br/>(aplicación)
  participant GW as Payment adapter<br/>(confirmEvent)
  participant RE as Reglas de dominio<br/>(payments-rules)
  participant U as MongoUnitOfWork<br/>+ repos (tx)

  P->>R: POST /api/webhooks/payments<br/>(payload firmado del proveedor)
  Note over R: middleware auth opcional / captura rawEvent
  R->>UC: services.payments.processWebhook({ rawEvent, tenantId })

  Note over GW: el adapter verifica la firma del proveedor<br/>y normaliza: operation · status · internalReference
  UC->>GW: gateway.confirmEvent(rawEvent)

  UC->>U: uow.withTransaction( fn )
  U->>U: findByProviderEvent(provider, eventId) → dedupe
  U->>U: findByInternalReference(tenantId, internalReference)
  U->>U: updateStatus(tx → approved)
  U->>U: updateStatus(appointment → confirmed / approved)
  UC->>RE: buildLedgerForApprovedCharge(…)
  UC->>U: ledger.create(2 entradas: commission + tenant_balance)
  U-->>UC: commit
  UC-->>R: { handled: true }
  R-->>P: 200 OK